MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Thresholds are not identified out of the variance - covariance matrix of the observed variables, but out of the crosstabs of the observed variables. The rule that you are using--identification depd=ends only on the unique elements of the covariance matrix--only applies to a subset of all structural equation models.

